@{
    ViewBag.Title = "How Exchanges Work";
}
<main class="container tw:mx-auto tw:w-full tw:max-w-[1400px] tw:px-4 my-5 tw:my-8 sb-guide-page">
    <header class="sb-page-heading">
        <span class="sb-eyebrow">The exchange, explained</span>
        <h1>Teach one thing.<br />Learn another.</h1>
        <p>SkillBridge helps two members teach each other, one skill in each direction.</p>
    </header>
    <ol class="sb-guide-steps">
        <li><span class="sb-guide-number">01</span><div><h2>Set up your profile.</h2><p>Add your name to explore. When you're ready to connect, choose a skill you can teach, a skill you want to learn, and the topics you know.</p></div></li>
        <li><span class="sb-guide-number">02</span><div><h2>Find a reciprocal match.</h2><p>For example, Amina can teach Python and wants SQL. Rahim can teach SQL and wants Python.</p></div></li>
        <li><span class="sb-guide-number">03</span><div><h2>Send a proposal.</h2><p>Amina asks to learn SQL and shares a goal, preferred pace, and first meeting idea. Rahim reviews it and chooses the skill he wants to learn from Amina.</p></div></li>
        <li><span class="sb-guide-number">04</span><div><h2>Agree on a plan and learn together.</h2><p>The catalog stages offer a starting point. Either partner can suggest changes to upcoming milestones; the other must agree. Both confirm a milestone when it is complete.</p></div></li>
        <li><span class="sb-guide-number">05</span><div><h2>Finish and rate.</h2><p>Once all stages in the exchange are confirmed, either member can complete the exchange. Both can then rate their experience.</p></div></li>
    </ol>
    <aside class="sb-guide-note">
        <h2>Good to know</h2>
        <p>You can read skills and community discussions before signing up. Requests, messages, and exchanges require an account.</p>
        <p>If an exchange cannot continue, either member can end it early and give a reason. It will not count as completed.</p>
    </aside>
    <div class="sb-hero-actions">
        <a class="btn tw:inline-flex tw:items-center tw:justify-center tw:gap-2 tw:rounded-xl tw:border-2 tw:border-sb-ink tw:px-4 tw:py-2 tw:font-extrabold tw:shadow-sb-small tw:transition-transform tw:hover:translate-x-[2px] tw:hover:translate-y-[2px] tw:dark:border-sb-night-ink btn-primary tw:bg-sb-blue-strong tw:text-white" href="@Url.Action("Skills", "Explore")">Browse skills</a>
        @if (!User.Identity.IsAuthenticated)
        {
            <a class="btn tw:inline-flex tw:items-center tw:justify-center tw:gap-2 tw:rounded-xl tw:border-2 tw:border-sb-ink tw:px-4 tw:py-2 tw:font-extrabold tw:shadow-sb-small tw:transition-transform tw:hover:translate-x-[2px] tw:hover:translate-y-[2px] tw:dark:border-sb-night-ink btn-outline-primary tw:bg-sb-card tw:text-sb-blue-strong" href="@Url.Action("Register", "Account")">Create an account</a>
        }
    </div>
</main>
